Package: spLeakage
Title: Audit Spatial Validation Against Prediction Targets
Version: 0.1.0.9004
Authors@R:
    person("Olatunji", "Johnson", email = "olatunjijohnson21111@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for auditing differences between spatial validation and a
    declared prediction target. Compares nearest-neighbour distance distributions
    and dependence-weighted contrasts, reports distribution crossings, and
    compares candidate validation schemes. These diagnostics describe mismatch
    in spatial prediction conditions; their relationship to predictive error
    depends on the prediction model. Legacy score-comparison and experimental
    simulation-calibrated functions are also provided with restricted scope.
